lex flex-col items-center justify-center"><div class="text-px20 mb-2 leading-[135%] font-bold">將 Yahoo 加入 Google 優先推薦來源</div><p class="text-px16 mb-3 leading-[135%]">將 Yahoo 設為首選來源，在 Google 上查看更多我們的精彩報導</p><img alt="Google Preferred Source" class="mb-3" height="153" loading="lazy" src="https://s.yimg.com/cv/apiv2/twnews/article-bts/google-prefered-source-illustration.svg" width="260"/><a data-ylk="elm:btn;itc:1;sec:google-ps;slk:add to google preferred source;" class="content-canvas-noclick-resp bg-button-primary text-px18 h-11 w-full rounded-[22px] px-8 py-2.5 text-center leading-6 font-medium text-white" href="https://www.google.com/preferences/source?q=tw.news.yahoo.com" target="_blank">加入首選來源<span class="sr-only">（另開新視窗）</span></a></div></div></dialog><button data-ylk="g:66aa65b9-be5a-35c6-aabe-8ecdc2ef71e5;sec:social-share;subsec:article-top;cpos:1;elm:btn;itc:1;slk:consolidated;" aria-label="分享" class="content-canvas-noclick-resp rounded-[50%] items-center justify-center border border-solid border-dirty-seagull min-w-[32px] h-[32px] lg:min-w-[44px] lg:h-[44px] mr-2 inline-flex lg:hidden"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" class="text-icon-primary"><path fill="currentColor" d="m7.95 1 4.844 4.844-1.344 1.343-2.55-2.55v6.056H7V4.637l-2.55 2.55-1.344-1.344zM1 8.743v5.95h13.9v-5.95H13v4.05H2.9v-4.05z"></path></svg></button><button data-ylk="g:66aa65b9-be5a-35c6-aabe-8ecdc2ef71e5;sec:cmmts;subsec:article-top;elm:cmmt_open;itc:1;cpos:2;slk:cmmt_open;" aria-label="留言" class="content-canvas-noclick-resp border border-solid border-dirty-seagull min-w-[32px] h-[32px] lg:min-w-[44px] lg:h-[44px] text-icon-primary rapid-noclick-resp mr-0 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-[99px] lg:hidden px-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="flex-none text-primary [&amp;_path]:fill-current"><path fill="currentColor" d="M9 1a6 6 0 0 1 0 12H7.688c-.877.657-1.989 1.483-2.688 2v-2.342A6.002 6.002 0 0 1 7 1zM7 2.6a4.4 4.4 0 0 0 0 8.8h2a4.4 4.4 0 0 0 0-8.8z"></path></svg><span class="ml-1.5"></span></button></div></div></header><div class="atoms" data-component="blocks"><a data-yga="{&quot;yInteractivityType&quot;:0,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;img&quot;}" data-ylk="elm:img;elmt:link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;" class="mb-module-gap" href="https://d1j71ui15yt4f9.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/22200450/0522%E4%BD%95%E6%AC%8A%E5%B3%B0.png"><div class="mx-auto w-fit max-w-full"><img alt="市議員何權峰建議參考韓國仁川經驗，社宅擴大婚育家庭認定並加碼租金補貼，以減緩少子化問題。（記者吳文欽攝）" class="rounded-lg" height="751" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/392b267572824f33dc67aa4de01e04071fef3691b62833cd61244ea57d955fb5/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fcdns.com.tw%2Fd0a8cef46b34626d8a544aab5b6e530e" width="960"/><figcaption class="text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere" style="max-width:960px">市議員何權峰建議參考韓國仁川經驗，社宅擴大婚育家庭認定並加碼租金補貼，以減緩少子化問題。（記者吳文欽攝）</figcaption></div></a><p class="mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave">記者吳文欽／高雄報導</p><p class="mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave">高雄市議員何權峰廿二日總質詢指出，高雄出生人口逐年下滑，顯示育兒補助未有效減緩人口減少。</p><p class="mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave">何權峰主張，育兒政策應從單純「救濟」走向多元協助，他建議參考韓國仁川經驗，社宅擴大婚育家庭認定並加碼租金補貼，以減緩少子化問題。</p><p class="mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave">何議員肯定鐵路地下化帶動新高雄火車站、綠園道、大都更計畫、滯洪池化身正義公園與雙湖公園、輕軌成圓、九如橋新建工程、三民區排水改善等多項建設，並爭取增設托嬰中心及長照量能。</p><div class="bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0"><div class="text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5">廣告</div><div class="mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]" id="sda-inbody-66aa65b9-be5a-35c6-aabe-8ecdc2ef71e5-1-iframe"><div class="bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]">廣告</div></div></div><p class="mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave">何議員指出，三民運動中心七月正式營運、陽明網球中心六月開放，盼整合打造三民運動休閒區。另三民公園第一期中軸帶工程預計十二月完工，他要求第一期完工後先部分開放。</p><div class="recommendation-contents"><div class="bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg"></div><div class="no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5"><div class="bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:w-[300px]"></div><div class="bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:w-[300px]"></div><div class="bg-marshmallow hidden h-[94px] w-[300px] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:block"></div></div></div><p class="mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave">他提到，高雄火車站周邊商圈串聯活化，三鳳中街暨光環境改造正辦理工程採購，後續盼優化長明商圈、後驛商圈，外擴打造高雄表參道。</p><p class="mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave">何議員關心岡山路竹延伸線、黃線、小港林園線進度，要求加快購置輕軌、紅橘兩線列車。</p><p class="mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave">何議員指出，果菜市場遷建六月底前完成發包啟動規劃，肉品市場朝原地轉型為冷鏈物流中心，可否因應紫線經過進行聯開？</p><p class="mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave">高鐵南延案明挖段縮短二點四公里，何議員要求應向居民說明是否拆除民宅。此外，翻轉高雄火車站的大都更計畫及周邊自主都更，市府應掌握進度、積極協調。</p></div></article><iframe class="mb-module-gap-lg" height="105" id="mkt-iframe-66aa65b9-be5a-35c6-aabe-8ecdc2ef71e5" loading="lazy" src="https://tw.buy.yahoo.com/smartbanner/article?site=news&amp;device=desktop&amp;bucketName=news-TW-zh-Hant-TW-def&amp;spaceId=794024955&amp;articleId=66aa65b9-be5a-35c6-aabe-8ecdc2ef71e5" title="mkt" width="100%"></iframe><div class="mb-7.5 lg:mb-5 lg:flex lg:items-center lg:justify-center" id="share-button-group-v2-66aa65b9-be5a-35c6-aabe-8ecdc2ef71e5"><button data-ylk="g:66aa65b9-be5a-35c6-aabe-8ecdc2ef71e5;itc:1;sec:cmmts;subsec:article-bottom;elm:btn;slk:view-comment;" class="group/view-comment border-brand-yahoo-purple text-view-comment-button-text lg:text-px20 rapid-noclick-resp hover:bg-view-comment-button-background-hover inline-flex h-11 w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-[99px] border border-solid px-6 leading-5 font-bold lg:h-13 lg:w-auto"><div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="flex-none text-primary [&amp;_path]:fill-current"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.5 2c4.694 0 8.5 3.756 8.5 8.39 0 4.633-3.806 8.39-8.5 8.39h-2.403c-1.31 1.104-2.954 2.464-3.992 3.22v-3.917C4.101 16.79 2 13.832 2 10.39 2 5.756 5.806 2 10.5 2zm-3 1.87c-3.648 0-6.605 2.919-6.605 6.52s2.957 6.52 6.605 6.52h3c3.648 0 6.605-2.92 6.605-6.52 0-3.601-2.957-6.52-6.605-6.52z"></path></svg>檢視留言</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="flex-none text-primary [&amp;_path]:fill-current"><path fill="currentColor" d="m11.996 17.763-7.685-7.686 1.838-1.839 5.847 5.848 5.848-5.848 1.838 1.839z"></path></svg></button><div class="flex flex-row items-center justify-center lg:ms-8 lg:mt-0 mt-4"><a data-ylk="g:66aa65b9-be5a-35c6-aabe-8ecdc2ef71e5;sec:social-share;subsec:article-bottom;elm:share;itc:0;slk:Facebook;" aria-label="分享至Facebook（另開新視窗）" class="mr-4 last:mr-0 lg:mr-5 rounded-[50%] items-center justify-center border border-solid border-dirty-seagull w-[44px] h-[44px] lg:w-[52px] lg:h-[52px] group flex hover:bg-[#0766ff]" href="https://www.facebook.com/dialog/feed?app_id=458584288257241&amp;link=https%3A%2F%2Ftw.news.yahoo.com%2Fshare%2F66aa65b9-be5a-35c6-aabe-8ecdc2ef71e5%3Fsoc_src%3Dsocial-sh%26soc_trk%3Dfb%26tsrc%3Dfb" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><svg xmlns