D%E9%81%94-2%E5%A4%A7%E6%8A%80%E8%A1%93%E7%8E%8B%E7%89%8C-%E5%85%A8%E5%A9%89%E6%8B%92-%E5%AF%A7%E6%AD%BB%E4%B8%8D%E7%95%B6%E5%9F%B7%E8%A1%8C%E9%95%B7-071300763.html\",\"canvassCommentCount\":48,\"clickthroughUrl\":\"https://tw.stock.yahoo.com/news/%E9%BB%83%E4%BB%81%E5%8B%B3%E9%80%80%E4%BD%8D-%E8%BC%9D%E9%81%94-2%E5%A4%A7%E6%8A%80%E8%A1%93%E7%8E%8B%E7%89%8C-%E5%85%A8%E5%A9%89%E6%8B%92-%E5%AF%A7%E6%AD%BB%E4%B8%8D%E7%95%B6%E5%9F%B7%E8%A1%8C%E9%95%B7-071300763.html\",\"description\":null,\"isHosted\":true,\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"EBC東森財經新聞\"},\"publishTime\":\"2026-11-13T07:13:00Z\",\"thumbnail\":{\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/E4C7574384B08F985272244DA078C7A909ECF602023C87AC8F1BB611F70A3ED0/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Febc__387%2F6380e5ebee4326bb39d90531a885e385.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/D9FFA1730CF023EE353DDEAF17780C801BDEF8451782F2375BBC7DC7055F0216/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Febc__387%2F6380e5ebee4326bb39d90531a885e385.jpg\",\"width\":184}],\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/ebc__387/6380e5ebee4326bb39d90531a885e385.jpg\"},\"summary\":\"輝達創辦人黃仁勳卸任執行長，震撼全球科技界。半導體研究機構SemiAnalysis指出，黃仁勳掌舵33年留下的權力真空，使內部兩大技術王牌均無意接班，甚至直言「寧死也不願接替」。\",\"overrideTitle\":\"黃仁勳退位！ 輝達「2大技術王牌」全婉拒：寧死不當執行長\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"title\":\"黃仁勳退位！ 輝達「2大技術王牌」全婉拒：寧死不當執行長\",\"uuid\":\"fada57cd-048c-3127-83cc-e8d4f9a77d33\",\"isLiveBlog\":false}},{\"asset\":{\"assetAttributes\":{\"modifiedTime\":\"2026-11-13T08:13:00Z\"},\"contentAttributes\":{\"canonicalUrl\":\"https://tw.stock.yahoo.com/news/%E9%BB%83%E4%BB%81%E5%8B%B3%E9%96%83%E8%BE%AD%E5%BE%8C%E8%B1%AA%E5%AE%85%E4%B8%8D%E5%B9%B3%E9%9D%9C-%E8%A6%AA%E5%8F%8B%E6%B9%A7%E5%85%A5-%E7%82%B8%E9%9B%9E%E5%A4%96%E9%80%81-%E7%A5%9E%E7%A5%95%E8%B2%A8%E8%BB%8A%E6%90%AC%E8%B5%B0-%E6%89%B9%E7%B4%99%E7%AE%B1-081300905.html\",\"canvassCommentCount\":129,\"clickthroughUrl\":\"https://tw.stock.yahoo.com/news/%E9%BB%83%E4%BB%81%E5%8B%B3%E9%96%83%E8%BE%AD%E5%BE%8C%E8%B1%AA%E5%AE%85%E4%B8%8D%E5%B9%B3%E9%9D%9C-%E8%A6%AA%E5%8F%8B%E6%B9%A7%E5%85%A5-%E7%82%B8%E9%9B%9E%E5%A4%96%E9%80%81-%E7%A5%9E%E7%A5%95%E8%B2%A8%E8%BB%8A%E6%90%AC%E8%B5%B0-%E6%89%B9%E7%B4%99%E7%AE%B1-081300905.html\",\"description\":null,\"isHosted\":true,\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"EBC東森財經新聞\"},\"publishTime\":\"2026-11-13T08:13:00Z\",\"thumbnail\":{\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8673C3618AD8C79BAEA9BB21678A7E65BCCE51DE8489FCF0EF09E0927605FB59/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Febc__387%2F46065a60e063949236f4c8bcd5268671.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/9B13CF50F9AF996612D601DA3214FA4451B18543D3A4B6DB624CCD1DBB7CCDFA/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Febc__387%2F46065a60e063949236f4c8bcd5268671.jpg\",\"width\":184}],\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/ebc__387/46065a60e063949236f4c8bcd5268671.jpg\"},\"summary\":\"輝達（NVIDIA）創辦人黃仁勳因接連爆出婚外情風波，12日宣布辭去總裁、執行長及董事職務，結束長達33年的掌舵生涯。英國《每日郵報》13日曝光黃仁勳請辭後的豪宅周邊畫面，位於舊金山、價值3800萬美元（約新台幣12.5億元）的豪宅陸續有親友到訪，還有炸雞外送送上門，另外一輛神祕白色貨車載著大型紙箱進出，現場動態引發外界關注。\",\"overrideTitle\":\"黃仁勳閃辭後豪宅不平靜！ 親友湧入、炸雞外送 神祕貨車搬走一批紙箱\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"title\":\"黃仁勳閃辭後豪宅不平靜！ 親友湧入、炸雞外送 神祕貨車搬走一批紙箱\",\"uuid\":\"de415428-117e-37c4-aa8b-0644cc16b749\",\"isLiveBlog\":false}},{\"asset\":{\"assetAttributes\":{\"modifiedTime\":\"2026-11-13T08:51:09Z\"},\"contentAttributes\":{\"canonicalUrl\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E7%BF%92%E8%BF%91%E5%B9%B3%E6%89%8D%E5%96%8A-%E7%B5%B1-%E5%AE%9A%E5%AF%A6%E7%8F%BE-%E5%9C%8B%E6%B0%91%E9%BB%A8%E5%89%8D%E7%AB%8B%E5%A7%94%E7%8E%87260%E4%BA%BA-%E7%AA%81%E6%8B%8B1%E5%80%A1%E8%AD%B0-085109059.html\",\"canvassCommentCount\":63,\"clickthroughUrl\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E7%BF%92%E8%BF%91%E5%B9%B3%E6%89%8D%E5%96%8A-%E7%B5%B1-%E5%AE%9A%E5%AF%A6%E7%8F%BE-%E5%9C%8B%E6%B0%91%E9%BB%A8%E5%89%8D%E7%AB%8B%E5%A7%94%E7%8E%87260%E4%BA%BA-%E7%AA%81%E6%8B%8B1%E5%80%A1%E8%AD%B0-085109059.html\",\"description\":null,\"isHosted\":true,\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"民視\"},\"publishTime\":\"2026-11-13T08:51:09Z\",\"thumbnail\":{\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3B3F3182D12020C5C732FB65ECD9F36DBA8EB54527E5CF82DCA4F672D8FF40CA/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftvn.com.tw%2F8dbbe76a61cea3bfd12af8c571c202e3.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/70AB2C872FE4C1C843439881B2E62745FEA27325AE607DBA4B6FACBBBEEAF6B7/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fftvn.com.tw%2F8dbbe76a61cea3bfd12af8c571c202e3.jpg\",\"width\":184}],\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/ftvn.com.tw/8dbbe76a61cea3bfd12af8c571c202e3.jpg\"},\"summary\":\"政治中心／綜合報導中共12日在北京舉行孫中山誕辰160週年紀念大會，中國國家主席習近平再度重申對台統一立場，強調將持續推動「和平統一、一國兩制」，並表示願意在「一個中國」原則及「九二共識」基礎上，與台灣各界人士就兩岸關係及國家統一問題展開對話協商。習近平更在演說尾聲宣稱「祖國完全統一一定要實現，一定能夠實現」，引發關注。與此同時，前考試院長關中、前立委丁守中等200多名統派人士，同樣在12日於台北發表「兩岸和平倡議」，呼籲降低兩岸敵意、恢復對話。對此，陸委會副主委梁文傑直言，真正威脅台海和平的是中共，呼籲和平應該找對對象，更強調「和平不是投降」，並以1949年國民政府遷台的歷史反問：「如果要投降，1949年就可以投降了，幹嘛要帶200萬人來台灣？」\",\"overrideTitle\":\"習近平才喊「統一一定實現」！國民黨前立委率260人「突拋1倡議」陸委會出手了\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"title\":\"習近平才喊「統一一定實現」！國民黨前立委率260人「突拋1倡議」陸委會出手了\",\"uuid\":\"e1d1ed9c-88d9-3cc7-a4aa-da449817b1f3\",\"isLiveBlog\":false}},{\"asset\":{\"assetAttributes\":{\"modifiedTime\":\"2026-11-13T17:18:43Z\"},\"contentAttributes\":{\"canonicalUrl\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E4%BD%A0%E5%AE%B6ok%E8%B6%85%E5%95%86%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E8%A6%81%E8%AE%8A%E6%A8%A3%E4%BA%86%EF%BC%81%E7%B4%85%E7%99%BD%E6%8B%9B%E7%89%8C%E6%8F%9B%E8%97%8D%E7%99%BD%EF%BC%8C%E8%A3%A1%E9%9D%A2%E7%AB%9F%E5%83%8F%E4%B8%80%E9%96%93%E8%BF%B7%E4%BD%A0%E8%B6%85%E5%B8%82-171804591.html\",\"canvassCommentCount\":2,\"clickthroughUrl\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E4%BD%A0%E5%AE%B6ok%E8%B6%85%E5%95%86%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E8%A6%81%E8%AE%8A%E6%A8%A3%E4%BA%86%EF%BC%81%E7%B4%85%E7%99%BD%E6%8B%9B%E7%89%8C%E6%8F%9B%E8%97%8D%E7%99%BD%EF%BC%8C%E8%A3%A1%E9%9D%A2%E7%AB%9F%E5%83%8F%E4%B8%80%E9%96%93%E8%BF%B7%E4%BD%A0%E8%B6%85%E5%B8%82-171804591.html\",\"description\":null,\"isHosted\":true,\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"Yahoo旅遊駐站達人\"},\"publishTime\":\"2026-11-13T17:18:04Z\",\"thumbnail\":{\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/25A74E0FF69802B5110F1985661999D0274C84E7C1D6019AC189CECBB53E1DEC/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fd29szjachogqwa.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fuser-uploaded%2F1_4548.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/F03DB56982763745B5F586CE1E2FDBE44E81D249B8918F93BC5EC84ADFCAA186/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fd29szjachogqwa.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fuser-uploaded%2F1_4548.jpg\",\"width\":184}],\"url\":\"https://d29szjachogqwa.cloudfront.net/images/user-uploaded/1_4548.jpg\"},\"summary\":\"OK超商（OKmart）在被美廉社母公司「三商家購」收購後，開始全面升級，結合美廉社和超商的特色，打造迷你社區超市，在OKmart柴米油鹽醬醋茶，啥都買的到啥都不奇怪。台中首家全新型態OKmart 台中柳陽東店，外觀招牌從紅白變成藍白配色，內部陳設擺列商品很有美廉社自我風格，不說還以為是新品牌超市呢，喜歡心樸市集商品的人，以後更多據點可以買到。\",\"overrideTitle\":\"你家OK超商可能要變樣了！紅白招牌換藍白，裡面竟像一間迷你超市\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"title\":\"你家OK超商可能要變樣了！紅白招牌換藍白，裡面竟像一間迷你超市\",\"uuid\":\"2f0c7c55-ad58-4d70-822a-7f415fcb973