fef\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",\"mabLogString\":\"$undefined\",\"originalTitle\":\"女星才剛奪金鐘！「驚人黑歷史」遭挖慘翻車　14年鐵粉傻眼發聲了\",\"photoVariants\":\"$undefined\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"三立新聞網 setn.com\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"logo\":{\"resolutions\":[]},\"sourceId\":\"$undefined\",\"url\":\"$undefined\"},\"providerContentUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-11-14T02:31:00Z\",\"summary\":\"「豆花妹」蔡黃汝憑《飢餓遊戲》勇奪第61屆金鐘獎實境節目主持人獎，出道16年首度敲鐘，星勢力全面爆發！獲獎後不僅戲劇、節目邀約不斷，更將在《無罪推定2》挑戰高難度台語律師角色，力甩昔日台語苦手形象，展現驚人蛻變。展望未來，她不僅持續籌備音樂創作，更公開向影視圈許願，渴望挑戰冷血邊緣人或輕熟媽媽等極端反差角色，徹底打破甜美框架，展現強大企圖心。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/setn.com.tw/6e31464a210c4f165a6990d086a00b32.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/25E8A13CD8316328A81ACABA44FF43B3792C614BB9392B2E243CF65D4648D18A/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fsetn.com.tw%2F6e31464a210c4f165a6990d086a00b32.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5936141ABE69D6D1DDF34D71A9654CD4B7A5B7313B80F27BCF242C3C2E87C5E5/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fsetn.com.tw%2F6e31464a210c4f165a6990d086a00b32.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"女星才剛奪金鐘！「驚人黑歷史」遭挖慘翻車　14年鐵粉傻眼發聲了\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"28b4fd04-18ae-3c73-94b8-084741fc3fef\"},{\"ad\":true},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E9%80%BC%E9%BB%83%E4%BB%81%E5%8B%B3%E8%BE%AD%E8%81%B7%E5%B9%95%E5%BE%8C%E9%BB%91%E6%89%8B%E6%B5%AE%E5%87%BA%E6%B0%B4%E9%9D%A2-%E5%85%A8%E9%83%A8%E7%B7%9A%E7%B4%A2%E9%83%BD%E6%8C%87%E5%90%91%E4%BB%96-035813152.html\"},\"canvass\":{