ary\":\"身價數十億元的「竹北吊車大王」胡漢龑日前打算入手夢幻名車勞斯萊斯，連吸睛的粉紅色內外裝都選好，卻因車商要求先付10%訂金後，必須一次付清剩餘90%尾款，且付款期限相當嚴苛，讓他當場氣炸放棄購買。這場千萬級豪車購車插曲曝光後引發熱議，也展現出有錢人買車不只講求品牌與性能，不合理的交易條件同樣會讓人直接打退堂鼓。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/ko/setn.com.tw/80c9856959f57adf3351e495c1deb03d.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/AC22C9791A233462CA05ABDC70FB48AACF94F79064FC09CD180ACBEABDE89235/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fsetn.com.tw%2F80c9856959f57adf3351e495c1deb03d.jpg\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/D654C75579B510BB328C6454BB5A9A06FA45547D4B17E1A0B815FD288DFC6AB3/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fsetn.com.tw%2F80c9856959f57adf3351e495c1deb03d.jpg\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"吊車大王退訂勞斯萊斯　直言：這是買過最離譜的一次\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"9cd0886f-0c43-3f61-80c4-398c2c7d1b38\"},{\"content\":{\"author\":\"$undefined\",\"canonicalUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E5%A6%BB%E5%A4%96%E9%80%81%E9%81%AD%E9%85%92%E9%A7%95%E6%92%9E%E8%85%A6%E6%AD%BB-%E5%A4%AB%E5%BF%8D%E7%97%9B%E6%8B%94%E7%AE%A1-%E5%A5%BD%E5%A5%BD%E7%95%B6%E5%A4%A9%E4%BD%BF-044700818.html\"},\"canvass\":{\"count\":32},\"categoryLabel\":\"$undefined\",\"clickThroughUrl\":{\"url\":\"https://tw.news.yahoo.com/%E5%A6%BB%E5%A4%96%E9%80%81%E9%81%AD%E9%85%92%E9%A7%95%E6%92%9E%E8%85%A6%E6%AD%BB-%E5%A4%AB%E5%BF%8D%E7%97%9B%E6%8B%94%E7%AE%A1-%E5%A5%BD%E5%A5%BD%E7%95%B6%E5%A4%A9%E4%BD%BF-044700818.html\"},\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"duration\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"6a18a5e8-89e2-373a-a821-6b243cade31a\",\"isHosted\":true,\"label\":\"$undefined\",\"liveVideo\":\"$undefined\",