:12:00Z\",\"summary\":\"身價數十億的「吊車大王」胡漢龑熱愛名車，近日卻在影片中大嘆折舊驚人。他透露曾花逾700萬元購入保時捷Panamera，開不到2年脫手竟現賠約300萬元。\",\"tags\":[],\"thumbnail\":{\"crop\":\"$undefined\",\"originalHeight\":\"$undefined\",\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/gotv_ctitv_com_tw_678/eeff0e390d8d1982c8792bf3ec780751.png\",\"originalWidth\":\"$undefined\",\"resolutions\":[{\"height\":280,\"tag\":\"498x280\",\"transformLabel\":\"498x280\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/B8073FE1ED5DADB6756E9B0701F240C4976F471FFF6FDD924AB3892AD9E91A85/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w498_h280_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fgotv_ctitv_com_tw_678%2Feeff0e390d8d1982c8792bf3ec780751.png\",\"width\":498},{\"height\":184,\"tag\":\"184x184\",\"transformLabel\":\"184x184\",\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/F2488A358DEB66CC9439F34515F882F60485B1D1A133D55C070927BAFDE5A3F6/subgraphmysterio/smartcrop_w184_h184_faces;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fgotv_ctitv_com_tw_678%2Feeff0e390d8d1982c8792bf3ec780751.png\",\"width\":184}]},\"title\":\"身價百億全白燒？吊車大王轉手保時捷「慘賠300萬」吐真相\"},\"contentType\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"fbd6cf6f-ac9e-3ffb-8058-c029662e4568\"}]}],\"\"]}]\n"])</script></body></html>